      "entries": [
        "The skelm draws upon the spirit of one of his deceased victims, tormenting their soul beyond the grave. Until the end of his next turn, the soul skelm gains regeneration 15 (deactivated by force or good; page 306), and he deals an extra 1d8 evil damage on his Strikes."
      ],
